# Keep the image build context small and deterministic. Anything not needed to produce the runtime
# image is excluded, which also means a change to a test or a doc cannot invalidate the Docker
# layer cache for the app itself.

# Editor and VCS
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
*.user
*.suo

# Build output
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules

# Not part of the API image
tests/
.github/
radar-v2-frontend/
*.md
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
